This is an independent C++/GGML implementation of NVIDIA GEM-X. NVIDIA's
GEM-X and SOMA research code are Apache-2.0 and are the pinned behavioral
references. Credit belongs to their authors for the models, architecture,
pre/postprocessing definitions, SOMA representation, and released weights.

The ViTPose observation network distributed with GEM-X uses Meta DINOv3. The
Body feature input and MHR identity data originate from Meta SAM 3D Body/MHR.
Their models and weights retain their upstream terms. The native crop arithmetic
was validated against and partially adapted from OpenCV's interpolation rules.
Relevant notices are preserved under LICENSES/.

The live person detector implements the YOLOX-X HumanArt inference path used by
GEM-X. YOLOX is Copyright 2021 Megvii, Inc. and licensed under Apache-2.0. The
two-stage identity association follows ByteTrack, Copyright 2021 Yifu Zhang,
licensed under MIT. Their license notices are preserved under LICENSES/.

GEM-X model weights are distributed separately under the NVIDIA Open Model
License and are not part of this repository. This repository does not relicense
NVIDIA, Meta, Momentum, OpenCV, GGML, or model-weight materials. Exact source
revisions and model hashes are recorded in reference/sources.json.

